### Message API Tests
### This file contains HTTP requests for testing the Message API endpoints

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@authToken = {{auth.response.body.token}}

### Authentication (if needed)
# @name auth
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
# Content-Type: application/json
# 
# {
#   "email": "admin@example.com",
#   "password": "Admin123!"
# }

### Get All Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get All Messages with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message?page=1&pageSize=10&searchTerm=test&ticketId=1&senderId=1&isRead=false
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Message by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Create New Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/message
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "This is a test message for ticket support",
  "ticketId": 1,
  "senderId": 1,
  "isRead": false
}

### Update Message
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/message/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "This is an updated test message",
  "ticketId": 1,
  "senderId": 1,
  "isRead": false
}

### Delete Message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/message/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Mark Message as Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/message/1/mark-read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Mark Message as Unread
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/message/1/mark-unread
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Mark All Messages in Ticket as Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/message/ticket/1/mark-all-read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Messages by Ticket ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message/ticket/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Messages by Sender ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message/sender/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get All Unread Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Unread Messages by Ticket ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message/ticket/1/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Messages by Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message/date-range?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Message Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Test Error Cases

### Get Non-existent Message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Non-existent Message
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/message/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "This message doesn't exist",
  "ticketId": 1,
  "senderId": 1,
  "isRead": false
}

### Delete Non-existent Message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/message/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Mark Non-existent Message as Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/message/999/mark-read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Invalid Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/message/date-range?startDate=2024-12-31&endDate=2024-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Create Message with Invalid Data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/message
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "",
  "ticketId": -1,
  "senderId": -1
}
